  "_note": "W65C51N Asynchronous Communications Interface Adapter. Pin table audited against WDC W65C51N datasheet (rev 2018-10-08). DIP-28 package. Full-duplex serial: TxD (pin 18), RxD (pin 23). Modem control: RTSB/CTSB/DTRB/DSRB/DCDB. Bus interface: D0-D7 (pins 8-15), RS0/RS1 (pins 16-17), PHI2 (pin 7), RWB (pin 5), CS0/CS1B (pins 2-3). Pin 19 is No Connect on W65C51N (was TxCLK on older R65C51). IRQB (pin 6, open drain). VSS=pin 1, VDD=pin 28.",
